    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12509" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-δῐώκω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-διώξομαι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>chase away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.102
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τῆς θηλείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					614a16
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀποδιώξει σαυτὸν ἐκ τῆς
				οἰκίας;</span>
			<i>take</i> yourself <i>off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1296
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ λυποῦν ἀποδίωκε τοῦ βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					410
				</span></i>
			; intr., <i>move,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				43.2
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be ridden at full speed,</i> of a horse, <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				3.7
			</span></i>.</div>
